               <msContents>
                  <summary>Formulario de los Medicos ditado por Dn. Joseph Ignacio García, y Jove Dr. y M[aest]ro y precidente del Real  
                     Tribunal del Proto-medicato de esta Ciudad Mexicana. Further receipts added in other hands, the last dated 1838. Index of symptoms, pp. 223-226. 
                     Primarily receipts drawn from the European pharmocopoeias; a few include indigenous materials, e.g. pulque, aguamiel de maguey.</summary>
                  
                 
                  <textLang mainLang="">Spanish</textLang>
                  
                  <msItem n="1" xml:id="MS_Amer_34_1">
                     
                     <author key="">Garcia Jove y Capelon, José Ignacio, d.1823.</author>                     
                     <nota>Garcia Jove was President of the Protomedicato througho ut the revolutionary era from 1795 until his death. [See M.59).</nota>
                     
                     <title key="">MS Amer 34</title>
                     
                                   
